        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/b5ddc8ee1148ac9c60861b45645d4a9e.avif?t=1784898520\" width=800 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to our Discord channel: haAuNAhBsg</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/fd1d8f6699948fa0e256832b907b105b.avif?t=1784898520\" width=800 height=128 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sprawl out like a starfish on the sun-baked beach and just zone out. Soak up the warm rays and listen to the rhythmic lull of the waves. Today, tomorrow, or even all day long—if you want to, you don't have to lift a single finger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/c4e0da5fc9a33ff355cd9b3c74e45ce4.poster.avif?t=1784898520\" width=1000 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/c4e0da5fc9a33ff355cd9b3c74e45ce4.webm?t=1784898520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/c4e0da5fc9a33ff355cd9b3c74e45ce4.mp4?t=1784898520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/c947faa77ef2b4e3c9437dc66831306e.avif?t=1784898520\" width=800 height=128 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cruise through fragrant flower fields or just lounge on a bouncy mushroom for hours. There are no deadlines, no timers, and absolutely no rush. Your time here is yours to spend on pure, unadulterated joy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/af1f0a0242aabdf9566aef71f58c87c8.poster.avif?t=1784898520\" width=1000 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/af1f0a0242aabdf9566aef71f58c87c8.webm?t=1784898520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/af1f0a0242aabdf9566aef71f58c87c8.mp4?t=1784898520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/a59b4def0501ff5f6112f626ce341e82.avif?t=1784898520\" width=800 height=128 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant a seed, get something bizarre! You’ll be harvesting everything from vibrant blooms to truly derpy crops. They’re weird, they’re quirky, and honestly? They’re impossible not to love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/5b3e4426a39dd9459920aa70fbc31309.poster.avif?t=1784898520\" width=1000 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/5b3e4426a39dd9459920aa70fbc31309.webm?t=1784898520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/5b3e4426a39dd9459920aa70fbc31309.mp4?t=1784898520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/c4984cabf71c196f5b6f6bd2b4c0d5cd.avif?t=1784898520\" width=800 height=128 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every nook and cranny of the island is packed with cheeky secrets. Rummage through every corner to collect useless but adorable toys. Because let’s be real—being cute and happy is the only thing that matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/33a05fa3d7af308748f56c4624ef74b3.poster.avif?t=1784898520\" width=1000 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/33a05fa3d7af308748f56c4624ef74b3.webm?t=1784898520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/33a05fa3d7af308748f56c4624ef74b3.mp4?t=1784898520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/9700e4b642eb73fdbb9cd8f4fc8ac129.avif?t=1784898520\" width=800 height=128 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your best friends along for the ride! Sweep them right out the door with a broom, or drag them into the water for a dip. Even the simplest moments become memories you'll treasure when you're together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/21f223481ffd5a79318cff5f307bf6bc.poster.avif?t=1784898520\" width=1000 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/21f223481ffd5a79318cff5f307bf6bc.webm?t=1784898520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/21f223481ffd5a79318cff5f307bf6bc.mp4?t=1784898520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/b5ddc8ee1148ac9c60861b45645d4a9e.avif?t=1784898520\" width=800 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to our Discord channel: haAuNAhBsg</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/fd1d8f6699948fa0e256832b907b105b.avif?t=1784898520\" width=800 height=128 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sprawl out like a starfish on the sun-baked beach and just zone out. Soak up the warm rays and listen to the rhythmic lull of the waves. Today, tomorrow, or even all day long—if you want to, you don't have to lift a single finger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/c4e0da5fc9a33ff355cd9b3c74e45ce4.poster.avif?t=1784898520\" width=1000 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/c4e0da5fc9a33ff355cd9b3c74e45ce4.webm?t=1784898520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/c4e0da5fc9a33ff355cd9b3c74e45ce4.mp4?t=1784898520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918500/extras/c947faa77ef2b4e3c9437dc66831306e.avif?t=1784898520\" width=800 height=128 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cruise through fragrant flower fields or just lounge on a bouncy mushroom for hours. There are no deadlines, no timers, and absolutely no rush. Your time here is yours to spend on pure, unadulterated joy.</p><p class